Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:28.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:31.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,...I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:52.70,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's chase our dreams...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:57.83,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... holding hearts burning...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:02.25,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... like the summer sunshine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:06.17,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we have courage...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:09.34,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... at 100 miles an hour...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:17.43,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I'm sure the door will open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:24.61,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since sadness is the road{\i0}\N{\i1}that leads to smiles...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:33.24,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... dull, dingy shoes will{\i0}\N{\i1}start to shine, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:39.91,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The most wonderful dream{\i0}\N{\i1}in the world...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:46.63,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pounding beat speeds up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:53.80,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The eyes are prisms that{\i0}\N{\i1}catch the wind...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:02:01.68,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... and in the voices of{\i0}\N{\i1}countless friends...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:08.52,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I feel happiness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:13.78,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,647.33)}LOVE'S HIGHWAY STARS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs52\c&H734F4E&\3c&HCFB09C&\bord4\move(737.33,800.67,737.33,276.67,24,1275)}Ladies' Locker Room
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:23.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:27.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:28.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh? Where's Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:31.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sleeping late, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:33.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,You didn't wake her up?\NYou're living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:39.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,I tried! Ice packs, firecrackers,\NBB guns, headphone blasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,...every day her immunity to wakeups\Ngets stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:45.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,So, I've decided to leave\Nher alone from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:50.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,We got days off this weekend, didn't we?\NWhat's with these red marks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:51.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? OH!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:53.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I couldn't help\Nseeing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:55.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:59.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot about replying!\NWhat should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:03.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Weekend? "Reply?"\NThis is fishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:09.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,There! I made it! No\Nthanks to Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:12.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh... Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:17.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's with that laugh? A-ha! I bet\Nyou're onto something juicy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:19.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:22.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,I heard that Yoriko saw the evidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,That poor Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:23.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,That poor Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:25.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,You think Miyuki hears her clock ticking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.31,0:03:26.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you want to try it, even once?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:27.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,Try what once?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:28.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh come on, you know what!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:30.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,You mean Nakajima wasn't #1 on her list?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:32.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,I never thought that this would happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:36.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,Good mornin'! Huh? What the?\NWhat's with those faces?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, I've got something to talk to\Nyou about. Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.49,0:03:41.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:44.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kennie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:47.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.46,0:03:48.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Lemme go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:49.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,An "Omiai?!" But you don't\Nknow that for sure, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:02.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is no time to act\Nso laid back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:05.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,A weekend meeting that\Nrequires an RSVP...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:08.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Can it be anything other than a formal\NOmiai matchmaking introduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:13.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,See! It's all your fault for not telling\Nher how you really feel about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:15.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Whatcha gonna do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:20.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,This means... you're gonna have\Nto kidnap her... or else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:21.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,K... Kidnap her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't you care if some guy\Nsteals her away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:26.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Take her away?! You're blowing\Nthis out of proportion...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:28.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,You've got to make sure that she\Ndoesn't make it to that meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:33.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey! Nakajima! Are you a man or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:35.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why can't you be a little more\Ndirect for a change?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Right! If you're a man, then go after\Nher until you get her or drop dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:40.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:45.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Would you like to go out touring,\NMs. Kobayakawa?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:49.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,No, using "Ms." is weird! Hmm...\N"Let's go out touring!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:52.73,Style1,,0,0,0,,If I'm asking her out, then I'd\Nbetter not sound so snooty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:55.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Why don't we go touring!\NHuh? Huh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:59.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ehh... Now that'll make me look like\Nan idiot! Maybe I should just ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:00.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nakajima?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:08.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, umm... HUH?!\NWhy, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:11.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Like it? It's Natsumi's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:13.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto's?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:17.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,She got so excited after I put the chamber\Nand aluminum swing-arm on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:21.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,...that she ended up\Ndriving it all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:22.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,But... I thought she wasn't\Nmuch of a motorhead...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:27.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, she sure can tell when something's\Nchanged... She can be rather picky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:31.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, actually I wanted you to\Ncheck something out for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:34.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,What is it? As long as you don't\Nneed it done right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,No, it can wait. I don't mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:37.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:40.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's no time to get excited\Nover bikes, am I right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:43.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,You know well that I've told you to go\Nto bed early many, many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:46.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're 15 minutes\Nlate for patrol!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.33,0:05:49.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's not it! What are you\Nwaiting for?! C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:52.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,Er... er... Well... Would\Nyou like to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:54.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's with you two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,You see, Nakajima here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:06:02.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,...is trying to keep you from your Omiai,\Nand is therefore asking you for a date!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:05.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,Er... er... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:09.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,He asks, "Are you free\Nthis weekend?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.43,0:06:11.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,Weekend? This weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:13.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Y... Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:18.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to do something\Nthis weekend... So I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:25.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,But, wait a minute here... Who said\Nanything about an Omiai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:32.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?! B... But... Even Natsumi said she\Nhad no idea about your plans, so that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:39.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ah... Er... Well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:03.03,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know about this... Maybe\NI'll just come home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:06.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gee, it's your reunion, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about a thing,\Nand just go have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:13.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,But, if I'm away, who knows what kind\Nof rumors about me will circulate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:18.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't get Nakajima mixed up\Nin anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's NOT what I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:23.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay... Get going!\NYou'll be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:26.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,If you see any cool classmates,\Npoint them in my direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, then, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:32.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Take care... Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Have a good trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:41.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,A-ha, she went to\Na co-ed school...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:56.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Lookin' miserable!\NWhat's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:03.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,It wasn't an Omiai, so what're\Nyou worried about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gee... Look, Nakajima, we all know\Nthat you're weak sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.84,0:08:08.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,...that when the going gets tough,\Nyou don't get going...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:13.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,...that you got no guts, are slow, and a\Nsissy. But, what can you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,You can't fight fate,\Nyou know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:17.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,H... Hey! This\Nain't helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:20.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,At times like this, you've got to\Nrelease all that pent-up stress!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,And I know just the\Nplace to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:24.73,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, c'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:28.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,That poor ZXR wants you\Nto take her out for a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Get your butt moving, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:42.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:52.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:54.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,You maniac! You tryin' to\Nkill me or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:00.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm reviving you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:13.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,I hope that I'll get a commendation\Nfrom the Captain for my work...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:15.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,...I hope that I can keep on talking\Nto Tokuno every day...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:17.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,...I hope my lunch-making\Nskills improve...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,...I hope for more samurai\Ndrama re-runs...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and I hope the summer will be\Nblessed with good weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go buy some\Nlucky charms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,A lucky charm? What,\Nfor "traffic safety?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:29.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,No, for a closer relationship\Nbetween you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:33.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Like the God of Love says,\N"Love Shall Flourish!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:34.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,Give it to Miyuki, and I'm sure\Nit'll work out for both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:37.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Er... No... I don't wanna\Nbe so blunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:38.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't try to squirm out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:41.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's not the "buying," it's the "giving..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.69,0:09:42.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:45.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,So, that's how you\Nwant it, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:49.54,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\bord4\c&H514238&\3c&HBF9C6B&\pos(534.66,212.67)\frz352.5}"Hotel Taihei Inn"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.84,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs42\bord4\3c&H1E1A21&\pos(1104,210)}Kimizu High School \NReunion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:51.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gee, long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:55.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki?! You're looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:57.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah! A grown-up woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,You all look different!\NI'm speechless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:03.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyuki, you're a cop\Nnow, right? Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Do you get involved in shootouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,No, not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:06.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Do you get in fights with crooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,Do you carry handcuffs and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,W... Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:20.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki went to a co-ed\Nhigh school...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:24.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,...that means, today's reunion...\Nwill also feature men!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:30.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,First time since graduation, eh?\NWell, have some!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:34.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kido...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:42.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,I wonder... if an old boyfriend\Nmight show up or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wanna step out with\Nme for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? Kido...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,That... I can't abide!\NAnd yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:56.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,You don't mind if Miyuki's old\Nboyfriend grabs her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:57.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,I DO mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:11:00.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,Then act! What're you waiting for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Taihei Inn, in Katsuura...\NHere we come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's kind of embarrassing in\Nfront of everyone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:13.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why... now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,I wanted to settle things,\Nonce and for all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:22.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're slow! A fly\Nis resting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:23.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:36.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's all in the past. I've tried\Nto forget all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just forget\Nthat it ever happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:39.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,We can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:42.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Even if you were to forget about it,\Nit'd always be on my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Here... The lunch money\Nyou lent me 3 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:59.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,At last, I've paid you back!\NBoy, it feels good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gosh... You haven't\Nchanged at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:06.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,I can never tell whether\Nyou're serious or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.67,Style2,,0,0,0,,"Taihei Inn"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:14.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we don't have\Na guest by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:16.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,This IS the Taihei Inn, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:17.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:18.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,This IS Katsuura City, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:19.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:24.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,Er, well... Is there another\NTaihei Inn in Katsuura?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:26.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:29.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! I know! It's in Chiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:32.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Katsuura City... in CHIBA\NPrefecture!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:41.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,N... No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:54.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, so what's\Nthe story?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,You know... your guy. What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.72,0:12:59.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,Is he tall? Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's going on? What are\Nyou talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:05.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Get this! Satomi is dating\Nsomeone from work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.72,0:13:06.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:12.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go out with someone from a\Ndifferent walk of life, but... I fell for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:17.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,So, it seems I didn't\Nneed to look far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:21.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice for a prince to arrive on\Na white stallion, but even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:26.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Exactly! It's not like I asked\Nfor it, but he came for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:29.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, when\Nyou're all blushed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:31.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,We know about being happily in love...\Nit's written all over your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.87,0:13:33.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:35.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Didn't need to look far, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:38.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look at you, Miyuki! What's\Nthe meaning of that sigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:39.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let me guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:41.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:43.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:44.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Just like I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:46.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,No! No! It's not like that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:48.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:49.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:51.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's no one!\NNo one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:54.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm just barely\Nkeeping up at work...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:57.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's no time to date a guy or anything\Nlike that... realistically speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:00.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,Married to your work, eh? You sure\Nhaven't changed at all, Miyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:03.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,You've always been\Nthat way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:07.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It was like, you weren't\Ninterested in guys at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:09.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Instead, you talked about your\Nhobbies all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:11.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,You were actually popular\Nwith the guys, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:14.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,So I was always thinking,\N"Damn! What a waste!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:18.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki wasn't interested in that, 'cause\Nshe had goals. Right, Miyuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any ambitions\Nlike that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:23.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,All I thought was, "It'd be nice\Nif I could get married early."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:26.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,Maybe you expect too much\Nfrom life, Miyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:31.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,I bet you're waiting for someone who's\Ntall, totally athletic, kind, sweet...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:36.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,...went to a top school, and makes\Nthe big bucks. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,W... Well, something\Nlike that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:43.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,That'd be a sight to see! I wonder what\NMiyuki's significant other will be like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:48.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, Nakajima, everyone screws up now\Nand then. Besides, you're from Suzuka...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:51.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,...so you wouldn't know about\Nthe two Katsuura's!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:54.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, it was partly my fault for not\Nrealizing it along the way, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:56.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Guess we got carried away with\Nthe drivin', you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,So I'm a wimp...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:14.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,...who's weak, and can't take the pressure\Nwhen the going gets tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.56,0:15:17.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,I got no guts, I'm slow,\NI'm a sissy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:22.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,And on top of that, I'm also a klutz, an\Noaf, and a dimwit... I'm hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:29.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima! Pathetic!\NYou're pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:30.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,T... Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:33.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll cheer you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.41,0:15:35.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,W... Wait a sec, Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:39.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Drink up and sing out in joy!\NGo for it, Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:42.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eyaah! Knock it off, Tsujimoto!\NWe won't be able to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's booze it 'til daybreak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:45.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,S... Somebody, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.13,0:15:47.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,We'll get busted for DWI!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Go for another bottle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:53.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Phew! You reek of Sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:55.66,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\frz2.989\pos(176,744.66)\c&H080C06&\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&}Katsuura Station
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:58.64,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\frz2.989\c&H080C06&\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&\move(176,744.66,176,-446.89,23,2984)}Katsuura Station
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:58.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get going\Nfrom here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.73,Style1,,0,0,0,,I was hoping that we could go to\Nan aquarium or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Too bad. Maybe next time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:06.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll introduce\Nyou to my boyfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:26.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,At the very least... he's tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:49.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,My! This is yesterday's\Nevening paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:52.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,If she was going out, Natsumi could've\Nat least put it inside the apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:06.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki... Is Nakajima home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:09.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,N... No. It seems\Nlike he's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:12.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,How could he go out in\Nthis kinda weather?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:14.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand this\Nbike riding thing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:16.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, I notice that you're also\Nout and about, Yoriko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:20.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I have a legitimate\Nexcuse... souvenirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:23.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm like a rat in a trap, eh? Well, make\Nsure everyone gets a share, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:25.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,These are those famous\NPeanut Rice-Cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:30.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know! Though, I wonder where\NNatsumi or Nakajima are...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:35.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, speak of the devil,\Nhere's Nakajima now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:36.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,C... Coming home\Nin the morning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,And? So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:53.14,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, Nakajima and Tsujimoto went\Nout touring, and stayed overnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:56.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,While Kobayakawa was out, right?\NIs he flirting or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:57.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's what\Nit boils down to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:18:00.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go around spreading\Nunsubstantiated rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:02.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,Y... Yes, sir... Sorry\Nabout that, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.73,Style1,,0,0,0,,The way I heard it, Nakajima's heart\Nwas broken, and he just snapped...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and asked Tsujimoto out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:09.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:14.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain...\Nif you would!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:29.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ummm... Ahem! Er... Miyuki?\NGot a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:31.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:31.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.17,0:18:37.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know all about it. You were just trying\Nto cheer Nakajima up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:40.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,W... Well... something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:43.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. Rumors\Ndon't mean anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:45.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! Miyuki, it's full!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.85,0:18:51.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, my! Let me see here...\NA rag! Where's a rag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.12,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\pos(268,582.01)\c&H857D7A&\bord4\3c&HC9CED5&}Health Checkup\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N{\c&HB8A594&}Take Good Care\Nof Your Teeth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,I heard that you fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:06.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Y... Yeah. I think it has\Nto do with this fever...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Fever?! You have a cold\Nor something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:11.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh... it's nothing much. I'm just a\Nlittle under the weather, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:14.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh... Oh, yeah! Thanks\Nfor the tasty souvenir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:17.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,I got them for everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,I got something for y-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:20.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,I gotta get going now. Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:26.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,I got something\Nfor you, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:32.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,She said not to worry about it, but I'm sure\Nshe's lying. She looked so upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:35.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's weird NOT\Nto worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.28,Style1,,0,0,0,,You just had to say something that was\Ntotally uncalled for, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:41.28,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi... don't be cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:48.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,Up 'til now, no matter how upset she was,\Nshe never avoided me like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:51.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:54.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Good grief! I can't take\Nthis anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.76,0:19:56.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wait, Tsujimoto! Where\Nare you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:58.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,Someplace nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:00.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima wants\Nto talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:05.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,Go on, tell her how\Nyou really feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:08.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,W... What?! Who, me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:11.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Come on! Tell her, like a\Nreal man should! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:12.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,B... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:14.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:16.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima! Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:20.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Everyone's rooting for you! Now pluck up\Nyour courage, and tell her how you feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:21.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:23.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Show her what you're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:24.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,Do it, Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko... you're at it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:29.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:32.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki, sorry... I didn't mean for\Nsomething like this to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:34.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're SO insensitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:37.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone for\Na while! Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:52.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Chief, here are today's reports, sir.\NPlease look through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.56,0:20:54.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,This many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:56.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,There's more, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:57.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,Urk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:03.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi, it's time\Nto go on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.16,0:21:06.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:13.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,This sure is getting tense!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:18.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Our work gets done alright, but\Nat this rate, WE won't last!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:21.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,This kind of a love triangle can't\Nbe taken lightly at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:25.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,I have to do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,Your cold is getting\Nworse, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:38.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,If you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:52.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,You know, Miyuki... I know that I\Ncan be insensitive sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.62,0:21:55.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,...'cause I can't figure certain things out\Nunless I'm told exactly what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:57.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,And, I tend to go full speed ahead and\Ntake my best shot, no matter what...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,I guess that's why I made\Nyour life hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:04.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,No. Maybe it's ME\Nwho's insensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.43,0:22:06.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,You see, I don't even know\Nmyself how I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why do two people\Nfall in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:14.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Isn't it because you feel that you\Nneed that certain someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:18.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,But, "need" and "love" aren't\Nthe same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.11,0:22:20.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,HUH?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:22.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sorry... I'm acting strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:26.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.95,0:22:27.74,Style1,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:33.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,He's making a run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:37.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,He's probably laughing because\Nthis is just a mini-patrol car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:39.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,We won't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:47.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:51.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey! Scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:58.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,Whew! Instant reaction! ...- SAFE! ...-\NSuch a close call!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:00.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.36,0:23:02.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.53,0:23:03.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kobayakawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.45,0:23:05.28,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks... Nakajima...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.45,0:23:07.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm not feeling\Nwell today...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:15.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! They're totally trashed! And this\Nwas a new pair I just got issued!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:26.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll go after that punk! You guys\Ntake it easy for now. Adios!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:29.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? HUH?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:32.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking over for us at\Na time like this? You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.97,0:23:35.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:39.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima needs\Nto be like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.77,0:23:42.50,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\pos(964,452.67)\c&H000000&\bord4\3c&HFFFFFF&}Japanese Word Processor           A4 Paper Size         40 Lines
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.77,0:23:42.50,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\pos(964,632.67)\c&H000000&}Schedule Proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:48.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,Recently, we've suffered the undesirable\Nconsequences of a non-trivial situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.91,0:23:52.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that both of you know\Nall too well what's causing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.29,0:23:54.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,And so, as your chief, I must\Nofficially inform you that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.66,0:23:56.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,...you, Miyuki Kobayakawa,\Nand you, Ken Nakajima...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.71,0:23:58.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,...in the hopes that you will\Nregain your friendship...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:24:00.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,...are hereby ordered to go\Non a date this weekend!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.96,0:24:02.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Here is your itinerary.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.63,0:24:05.34,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H3C517C&\b0\an7\pos(249.33,443.34)}Schedule Proposal\N{\fs32}\N\N\N\N\NHere I schedule the date of Miss Kobayakawa and Mr. Nakajimain order to resolve their issues.\N\N\N\N\NDate and Time: Sunday, this weekend\N\N\N\N\N\NMeet in front of Kinshicho Station\N\N\N\N\NWatch the movie "Gone with the Wind" at Kinshicho Shochiku\N\N\N\N\NShopping at a department store\N\N\N\NDinner at the restaurant "Tobira"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:05.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,I expect you to scrutinize it carefully\Nand follow it as exactly as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.01,0:24:07.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.85,0:24:16.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Meet her by the Kinshicho train\Nstation, at 3 PM..."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.69,0:24:18.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.86,0:24:24.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kobayakawa... I hope\Nthis works out for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.53,0:24:26.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,M... Me too...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.16,0:24:38.12,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.98\fs42\bord4\pos(876,622)}Bill to: Bokuto Police Station
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:43.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh... uh... next is\NKinshi Park...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:48.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ostrich 1 to all officers; the subjects are\Nheading towards the final destination!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:52.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,They are behaving informally. Date is\Nproceeding according to plan. Over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.55,0:24:55.14,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger! Natsumi? Yoriko?\NDid you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.60,0:24:57.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger! And now, we\Nget to see the finale!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.52,0:25:00.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,They've just passed "Checkpoint\NCharlie!" Over!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.15,0:25:04.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Confirmed sighting of the subjects!\NI shall continue the stakeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.03,0:25:13.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,I feel bad, making you hang out with me\Nall day, when you've just been sick...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.28,0:25:15.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't, because I'm\Nperfectly fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.54,0:25:17.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.12,0:25:20.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,I've washed it for\Nyou. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:25.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,I... 'cause Tsujimoto told me... NO!\NI mean, I wanted you to have this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.42,0:25:29.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,YES! Good going! "Love\NShall Flourish!"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:30.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Traffic Safety?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:31.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.01,0:25:35.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're in the traffic safety\Ndepartment, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.43,0:25:39.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,Even though we were ordered to be\Nhere, I'm happy that this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.56,0:25:41.14,Style1,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:46.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nakajima.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:53.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna peek?\NIt's looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.07,0:25:56.03,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.92,0:26:07.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,We've just been notified of a car crash\Nin front of the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:10.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,Everyone, abort the current operation\Nand head over to the scene. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.05,0:26:13.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.01,0:26:14.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Time for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:16.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.43,0:26:20.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.02,0:26:27.27,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After the rain, scattered diamonds come.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.98,0:26:24.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! You're over there, aren't you?\NC'mon, let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:25.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,S... Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.27,0:26:29.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,Right! Yoriko, you take care of the stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.40,0:26:31.11,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll be crossing bridges of rainbows...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.23,0:26:31.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,It was just getting good!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.19,0:26:34.78,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... nonstop, no matter what we face.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.69,0:26:35.03,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Well... we just happened\Nto be walking nearby, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.91,0:26:44.71,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't like chicken-hearted softies... You're Under Arrest!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.03,0:26:41.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next time... ask me out without the{\i0}\N{\i1}plan and without the entourage!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.36,0:27:15.70,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the smile you always have.{\i0}\N{\i1}With all the passion I have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:25.08,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I will protect you from sighs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.21,0:27:33.01,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sunset skyline flashes past{\i0}\N{\i1}in my side-view mirror.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.09,0:27:40.60,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the road I drive on every day,{\i0}\N{\i1}believing in my dreams.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.68,0:27:48.48,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On rainy days, windy days, and days{\i0}\N{\i1}when I wanted to throw it all away...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.61,0:27:56.32,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... you smiled as you{\i0}\N{\i1}sat beside me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.61,0:28:06.08,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the unchanging vista, the sky{\i0}\N{\i1}that we watch together.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.12,0:28:12.92,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I'm confident that I can{\i0}\N{\i1}hang in there, if it's for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.00,0:28:21.43,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the smile you always have.{\i0}\N{\i1}With all the passion I have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.51,0:28:21.64,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I will protect you from sighs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:28.02,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love this town where we{\i0}\N{\i1}happened to meet...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:44.08,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,700.67)}And Speaking of Our Heroines...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.66,0:28:46.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi, it was a short year being your\Npartner and all, but it was great fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.33,0:28:47.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.75,0:28:50.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? Miyuki, you make it\Nsound like a farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.00,0:28:52.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! Don't go! Waah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.88,0:28:54.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Go?!" Where to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.30,0:28:56.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto! It won't be the\Nsame without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.55,0:28:58.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Take care! Here's a going-away present!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.34,0:28:59.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,All of us at Bokuto Police Station\Nare proud of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.01,0:29:01.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,We look forward to seeing you triumph\Nin your future endeavors!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.01,0:29:05.10,Style1,,0,0,0,,See you again in You're Under Arrest,\NFile 4, "On The Road, Again."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.22,0:29:06.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! It's our last assignment!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.77,0:29:11.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know what's going on,\Nbut I'll take my best shot at it!
